lor>#<color=#ffe93d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe94d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe94d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe95d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe95d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe96d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe96d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe97d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe97d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe98d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe98d>Classic Mode</color>#<color=#ffe99d>经典模式</color>#<color=#ffe99d>Classic Mode</color>闪电雷霆Thunderstrike塔隆Talon�g塔隆，30岁，前黑须掠空团王牌飞行员，出身风暴海域，因家人被掠而被迫加入空贼，后因雷帝的残暴而叛逃，遇见雷克斯一行。高大壮硕，眼神永远带着不服输的火。性格豪爽暴躁，自信到近乎自大，最爱炫技，也最恨别人动他的“家人”。他的飞行器是“闪电雷霆”。��Talon, age 30, former ace pilot of the Blackbeard Sky Raiders. Born in the Storm Seas, he was forced to join the sky pirates after his family was captured, then defected because of the Thunder Emperor's cruelty and met Rex's group. Tall and muscular, with eyes that always burn with defiance. Bold and hot-tempered, confident to the point of arrogance, he loves showing off and hates anyone touching his "family." His aircraft is the "Thunderstrike."$<color=#ffe100d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe100d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe101d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe101d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe102d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe102d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe103d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe103d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe104d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe104d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe105d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe105d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe106d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe106d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe107d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe107d>Classic Mode</color>	火花雀Spark Finch�}伊莎贝拉是铁风城技师协会的天才实习生，外号“小火花”，因意外发明高效引擎被协会破格提拔。她外表娇小可爱，但性格迷糊，常在修理飞行器时弄错零件或引发小爆炸，但正义感爆棚，坚信“技术要让天空更美好！”她加入赏金猎人行列，誓言守护正义。她的飞行器是“火花雀”。��Isabella is a genius intern at the Iron Wind City Technicians' Guild, nicknamed "Sparky." She was promoted ahead of schedule after accidentally inventing a high-efficiency engine. Petite and adorable but scatterbrained, she often grabs the wrong parts or causes small explosions while repairing aircraft. Yet her sense of justice overflows, and she firmly believes "technology should make the skies more beautiful!" She joined the bounty hunters, vowing to protect justice. Her aircraft is the "Spark Finch."$<color=#ffe108d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe108d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe109d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe109d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe110d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe110d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe111d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe111d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe112d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe112d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe113d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe113d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe114d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe114d>Classic Mode</color>$<color=#ffe115d>经典模式</color>$<color=#ffe115d>Classic Mode</color>	超新星	Supernova	铁之峰Ironpeak�M铁之峰是一个神秘的流落云海大陆的异域游侠，穿越空间风暴时失去记忆，带来远超本土科技的未来战机，象征高科技正义的铁誓光芒。他如天生英雄般热情守护，也有爱迟到的小缺点，但正义感总让他在最后关头准时赶到。他的飞行器是“超新星”。��Ironpeak is a mysterious foreign ranger stranded on the Cloud Sea Continent. He lost his memory crossing a spatial storm and brought a future fighter far beyond local technology, a symbol of the iron-clad light of high-tech justice. He protects others with the passion of a born hero, with the small flaw of often being late, yet his sense of justice always gets him there right on time. His aircraft is the "Supernova."<color=#ffe92d>活动</color><color=#ffe92d>Event</color>鳌宝Aobao	敖小鱼	Ao Xiaoyu�?敖小鱼，东海鳌山氏族的小公主，外表12岁（实际99岁），软萌可爱如邻家少女。性格天然爱笑，迷糊中带亲和力。她驾驭活体鳌鱼“鳌宝”，平时如玩偶大小，战斗就会化身巨型萌兽。小鱼的梦想是攒钱买糖葫芦、让大家坐鳌宝背开心冒险！��Ao Xiaoyu, the little princess of the Aoshan Clan of the East Sea. She looks 12 (actually 99), soft and cute like the girl next door. Naturally cheerful and a bit scatterbrained, yet endearing. She rides the living turtle-fish "Aobao," usually doll-sized but transforming into a giant cute beast in battle. Xiaoyu's dream is to save up for candied hawthorns and take everyone on happy adventures on Aobao's back!红隼Kestrel海莉Hailey�t海莉是出身于守护军团的战术官，早年经历空贼突袭，目睹队友牺牲后，她誓言守护云海——“每一步计算，每一击必中”。性格冷静果决、充满智慧与责任感，看似冷漠但绝不是无情。在发现晶核被滥用后，加入赏金猎人行列，以精密战术守护云海平衡。她的飞行器是“红隼”。��Hailey is a tactical officer from the Guardian Legion. After surviving a sky pirate raid early on and witnessing her comrades' deaths, she vowed to protect the Cloud Sea—"every step calculated, every shot on target." Calm and decisive, full of wisdom and responsibility, she seems cold but is never heartless. After discovering the Crystal Cores were being abused, she joined the bounty hunters, protecting the Cloud Sea's balance with precise tactics. Her aircraft is the "Kestrel."深渊古龙Abyssal Dragon丝兰·莫尔甘Silan Morgan��丝兰·莫尔甘出身恶魔世界显赫的莫尔甘家族，是正统高等魅魔贵族。她因深渊裂隙意外坠落至云海大陆，对世间万物心生好奇，偏爱人类创造的各式趣味。她性格慵懒魅惑，向来以旁观者的姿态享受生活。不满空贼扰乱秩序、破坏自己的玩乐天地，她选择暂时加入主角一行守护此方环境。她的飞行坐骑，是与她缔结永恒契约的深渊古龙「阿斯莫德」。�MSilan Morgan comes from the illustrious Morgan family of the demon world, an orthodox high-ranking succubus noble. She accidentally fell to the Cloud Sea Continent through an abyssal rift and grew curious about all things in the world, favoring the various amusements created by humans. Lazy and seductive by nature, she has always enjoyed life as an onlooker. Displeased by the sky pirates disrupting order and ruining her playground, she chose to temporarily join the protagonists to protect this realm. Her flying mount is the abyssal dragon "Asmodeus," bound to her by an eternal pact.	黑铁场Iron League	青铜场Bronze League	白银场Silver League	黄金场Gold League	钻石场Diamond League	大师场Master League
