选择加强自己的武器，或者是选择新的武器，为首领战准备！[We cleared another stage! Upgrade a weapon or pick a new one to prepare for the boss fight!6烈风空贼团的首领就在前方，打起精神！>The leader of the Gale Sky Raiders is just ahead—stay sharp!<丽莎，你还是适可而止吧，我不想和你开战。?Lisa, you should stop while you can. I don't want to fight you.B雷克斯，你还是那么天真，谁胜谁负还不知道呢！7Rex, you're still so naive. Who wins is anyone's guess!快点击配置上装备吧。Tap to equip your gear.a战机是你最可靠的伙伴，升星解锁后会获得更多的词条，记得及时提升噢~aYour plane is your most reliable partner. Star it up to unlock more affixes—upgrade it in time!U收集足够的战机碎片，就可以解锁和升级战机，快来操作一下把~HCollect enough plane shards to unlock and upgrade planes. Give it a try!'装备槽出现升级标志即可升级EWhen an upgrade icon appears on an equipment slot, you can upgrade it��欢迎来到飞行执照系统，你可以在这里激活“战斗大师”和“强化大师”的称号，获得更多提升。��Welcome to the Pilot License system. Here you can activate the "Battle Master" and "Enhancement Master" titles for more bonuses.9消耗金币和飞行员心得，就可以激活属性点;Spend coins and Pilot Insights to activate attribute points*你可以自由切换武器加成的效果2You can freely switch between weapon bonus effectsc经典模式是飞行员挑战自我的最重要模式，来一试身手拿到最高的分数吧！gClassic Mode is the ultimate self-challenge for pilots. Show your skills and aim for the highest score!-选择合体的好友，你可以变得更强0Choose a friend to fuse with and become stronger:别忘了升级装备，可更好的提升你的战力噢~6Don't forget to upgrade your gear to boost your power!@商城抽奖会产出史诗装备，快来试试你的运气吧~5The shop's draws can yield Epic gear—try your luck!.获得更高品质的装备，记得替换噢~7When you get higher-quality gear, remember to equip it!C强化大师会带来不同的升级效果，别忘了一起升级~SEnhancement Master offers various upgrade effects—don't forget to upgrade it too!9消耗金币和工程师心得，就可以激活属性点>Spend coins and Engineer Insights to activate attribute pointsO通过地图章节，可以通过挂机得到更多奖励，离线也有收益~KClear map chapters to earn more idle rewards—you earn even while offline!g普通挂机奖励通过积累时间而来，快速挂机奖励通过消耗体力和观看广告而来~hNormal idle rewards accumulate over time; fast idle rewards come from spending stamina and watching ads.U你收集到的战机碎片，可以用于战机升星，解锁更多战机的词条~YThe plane shards you collect can be used to star up planes and unlock more plane affixes.C升级战斗大师的轨道，可以快点解锁下一阶的称号~EUpgrade the Battle Master track to unlock the next-tier title faster.C金币大战是获取大量金币的娱乐玩法，快来参加吧~CCoin War is a casual mode for earning lots of coins—come join in!u晶片是提供各种加强效果的核心道具，可以在晶片背包这里进行镶嵌操作，可别忘了噢。`Chips are core items that grant various boosts. Socket them here in the Chip Bag—don't forget!@按照你的偏好镶嵌晶片，可以更好的辅助你战斗~;Socket chips to your liking to better support your battles.p首领挑战是考验你技巧和战力的玩法，快来迎战那些著名的空贼吧！会有装备奖励噢~eBoss Challenge tests your skill and power. Take on those famous sky pirates—there are gear rewards!X只要激活本阶的10个点，再完成所有挑战，就可以解锁战斗大师3阶~_Activate all 10 points of this tier and complete all challenges to unlock Battle Master Tier 3.g解锁战斗大师3阶，就能解锁新的局内武器，还有很多强力的加成，助你通关！pUnlocking Battle Master Tier 3 grants a new in-battle weapon and many powerful bonuses to help you clear stages!X只要激活本阶的10个点，再完成所有挑战，就可以解锁强化大师3阶~dActivate all 10 points of this tier and complete all challenges to unlock Enhancement Master Tier 3.F解锁强化大师3阶，就能获得强力的加成，助你通关！UUnlocking Enhancement Master Tier 3 grants powerful bonuses to help you clear stages!a空贼讨伐是最新的娱乐玩法，可以通过敌人的封锁击败首领获得战机碎片~vSky Pirate Hunt is the newest casual mode—break through the enemy blockade and defeat the boss to earn plane shards.e你已经收集了5个同样品质的相同部位晶片，可以尝试合成更高品质的晶片了~_You've collected 5 chips of the same quality and slot—try synthesizing a higher-quality chip!^获得足够数量的同一装备，即可合成为更高品质的装备~快来合成看看！WCollect enough of the same equipment to synthesize higher-quality gear—give it a try!*快点把所有空位置都装备上吧。$Fill all your empty slots with gear.]PK玩法是可以跟其他飞行员进行竞技的玩法，获胜了还有丰厚的奖励噢~IPK mode lets you compete against other pilots—win for generous rewards!X只要激活本阶的10个点，再完成所有挑战，就可以解锁战斗大师2阶~_Activate all 10 points of this tier and complete all challenges to unlock Battle Master Tier 2.g解锁战斗大师2阶，就能解锁新的局内武器，还有很多强力的加成，助你通关！pUnlocking Battle Master Tier 2 grants a new in-battle weapon and many powerful bonuses to help you clear stages!X只要激活本阶的10个点，再完成所有挑战，就可以解锁强化大师2阶~dActivate all 10 points of this tier and complete all challenges to unlock Enhancement Master Tier 2.[解锁强化大师2阶，就能解锁僚机，还有很多强力的加成，助你通关！gUnlocking Enhancement Master Tier 2 unlocks wingmen and many powerful bonuses to help you clear stages!m击败不同的首领，将会得到不同的奖励。这些恶党头目的悬赏奖励是珍贵的晶片噢~kDefeating different bosses yields different rewards. The bounties on these gang leaders are precious chips!3雷克斯哥哥！碧波上空全是空贼机群！?Big bro Rex! The skies over Biru are full of sky pirate fleets!0坐稳，小火花。我们过去会会他们。*Hold on tight, Sparky. Let's go meet them.小喽啰·胖墩Minion · Chubby兄弟们，抢了就跑！Boys, grab it and run!小喽啰·矮司令Minion · Short Commander左翼包抄，右翼掩护！"Left wing flank, right wing cover!小喽啰·高沉默Minion · Tall Silent……（摇头）...(shakes head)*他们堵住了航路了！火力好猛！&They've blocked the route! Heavy fire!-小火花，护盾开满，跟我冲过去！#Sparky, shields up, charge with me!'丽莎大姐头有令，全员开火！)Boss Lisa's orders—everyone, open fire!等等，我肉还没吃完！!Wait, I haven't finished my meat!……（耸肩）...(shrugs)0他们留信说“敢来主岛就来试试”！8They left a note: "Come to the home island if you dare"!*丽莎的风格……好，我们接招。0That's Lisa's style... Fine, challenge accepted.N雷克斯哥哥！空岛后面有个超大的敌机影子，肯定是丽莎！QBig bro Rex! There's a huge enemy shadow behind the sky island—it must be Lisa!9小火花，准备好。我们得冲进去见她一面。5Get ready, Sparky. We have to charge in and meet her.!大姐头来了！我们顶住！ The boss is here! Hold the line!顶不住…我饿了…Can't hold... I'm hungry...?雷克斯哥哥！黑旗到处都是，黑须海盗出动了！EBig bro Rex! Black flags everywhere—the Blackbeard pirates are out!?小火花，护盾开好。今天我们闯闯他们的地盘。1Shields ready, Sparky. Today we storm their turf.f哈哈哈！小崽子们，欢迎来到老子的风暴海域！谁敢进来，就别想活着出去！JHahaha! Brats, welcome to my Storm Seas! Whoever enters won't leave alive!9烈风团散了以后，我们只好投靠黑须团啦！=After the Gale gang broke up, we had to join the Blackbeards!对啊，这里饭管饱！%Yeah, and the food here is plentiful!……（点头）	...(nods)9（引擎轰鸣）抱歉来晚了！黑胡子现身了！9(Engine roaring) Sorry I'm late! Blackbeard has appeared!?塔隆，你以前就是黑须团的王牌，为什么叛逃？>Talon, you were once the Blackbeards' ace. Why did you defect?]因为他为了“荣耀”连我重要的人都不放过……今天我来结束这一切。LBecause for "glory" he spared no one I cared about... Today I'll end it all.塔隆叛徒又出现了！!The traitor Talon shows up again!$他以前是我们团最能打的！0He used to be the strongest fighter in our gang!$哇！那艘雷霆骷髅号好大！&Whoa! That Thunder Skull ship is huge!K那是黑胡子的旗舰……当年我就是从这艘船上逃出来的。HThat's Blackbeard's flagship... I escaped from that very ship back then.!塔隆，我们一起冲破它！'Talon, let's break through it together!?塔隆哥哥，你以前到底和黑胡子是什么关系啊？:Big bro Talon, what was your relationship with Blackbeard?��……他曾经是我最敬重的老大。为了“海盗荣耀”，他下令烧掉我的村子，只因为村里不肯交保护费……那天我逃出来，发誓再也不为这种荣耀卖命。��...He was once the boss I respected most. For "pirate glory," he ordered my village burned, just because they refused to pay protection... That day I escaped and swore never to serve such glory again.塔隆……原来是这样。!Talon... so that's what happened.6太可怜了……我们一定要帮你讨回公道！(So tragic... We'll help you get justice!'塔隆，你这叛徒终于回来了！,Talon, you traitor, you've finally returned!W黑胡子，你为了荣耀连我重要的人都不放过，今天我来讨个公道！NBlackbeard, for glory you spared no one I cared about. Today I demand justice!?雷克斯哥哥！前面遗迹突然冒出好大一片迷雾！;Big bro Rex! A huge fog suddenly rose from the ruins ahead!0小火花，护盾开满。我们过去看看。*Shields up, Sparky. Let's go check it out.<黑胡子炸了以后，这里肯定有没人管的晶核！EAfter Blackbeard blew up, there must be unclaimed Crystal Cores here!$我已经闻到食物的味道了！I can already smell food!9哇！那三个笨蛋把雾里的水晶装置撞坏了！DWhoa! Those three idiots crashed into the crystal device in the fog!0那是星图核心……有人在操控预言！AThat's the star-map core... Someone is manipulating the prophecy!神秘少女Mysterious GirlQ谁敢破坏我的星图！你们这些扰乱命运的家伙……给我出来！@Who dares damage my star map?! You who disturb fate... come out!喽啰三人组Minion Trio-完蛋了！我们好像撞到大人物了！/We're done for! We seem to have hit a big shot!<敌机全冲出来了！弹幕好漂亮……但好危险！IAll the enemies rushed out! The barrage is beautiful... but so dangerous!<小火花，坚持住！那个神秘的少女就在前面！5Hold on, Sparky! That mysterious girl is right ahead!o哼～你们这些笨蛋，刚刚撞坏的只是外围装置而已。现在真正的星图已经启动了哦～VHmph~ You fools, you only broke the outer device. Now the real star map has activated~?雷克斯哥哥！前面有个超级大的星图亮起来了！/Big bro Rex! A huge star map just lit up ahead!N那是完整的星图……她在用晶核强行改写云海的能量流向！kThat's the complete star map... She's using Crystal Cores to forcibly rewrite the Cloud Sea's energy flows!B哼～云海很快就会按照我的预言变成永恒秩序啦！IHmph~ The Cloud Sea will soon become eternal order, just as I prophesied!l星图早已注定，云海必须归于永恒秩序……你们这些扰乱命运的人，必须消失哦～lThe star map is foretold; the Cloud Sea must return to eternal order... You who disturb fate must disappear~E你就叫幻月吗，你真的要为了一个预言伤害大家吗？LSo you're called Phantom Moon? Will you really hurt everyone for a prophecy?9我亲眼看到的……所以我必须亲手实现它！9I saw it with my own eyes... so I must fulfill it myself!i雷克斯哥哥，这就是铁风城，我的家乡。我以前就是在这里学习机械工程的……ZBig bro Rex, this is Iron Wind City, my hometown. I studied mechanical engineering here...铁锤伯爵Count Hammer��咔咔……欢迎来到铁风城。这里欢迎所有追求进步与永恒的生命加入。我们将共同创造一个没有痛苦、没有衰老的完美世界。��Clank clank... Welcome to Iron Wind City. All life that seeks progress and eternity is welcome to join. Together we'll create a perfect world without pain or aging.9太好了！伯爵大人欢迎我们！我们加入了！'Great! The Count welcomes us! We're in!!有饭吃还有永恒！走起！Food and eternity! Let's go!0小火花……这话听起来有点不对劲。)Sparky... that doesn't sound quite right.W看！那是他们的补给船队……上面装了好多奇怪的金属舱和管线。LLook! That's their supply fleet... loaded with strange metal pods and pipes.K小火花，我们跟上去看看。不能让他们继续做危险的事。LSparky, let's follow them. We can't let them keep doing something dangerous.u雷克斯哥哥……其实铁锤伯爵以前是我的导师。他一直教导我，要让人类变得更完美……lBig bro Rex... actually, Count Hammer was once my mentor. He always taught me to make humans more perfect...'无人机像黑云一样扑过来了！.The drones are swarming in like a black cloud!E伯爵大人！我们刚加入，您怎么派无人机抓我们？！:My lord Count! We just joined—why send drones after us?!0救命啊！我们不想被改造成机器人！-Help! We don't want to be turned into robots!……（疯狂挣扎）...(struggling wildly)H小火花！三人组要被抓去改造了！我们冲过去救他们！VSparky! The trio is about to be captured and converted! Let's charge in and save them!T那些无人机把三人组抓走了！导师……他真的要改造所有人吗？RThose drones took the trio away! Mentor... is he really going to convert everyone?`小火花，别犹豫了！不管他以前是不是你导师，现在他已经走火入魔了！QSparky, don't hesitate! Whether or not he was your mentor, he's lost himself now!-我们得快点。三人组撑不了多久！+We have to hurry. The trio won't last long!6……嗯！我不能再让导师继续错下去了！?...Right! I can't let my mentor keep going down the wrong path!��伊莎贝拉……我的得意门生，你终于回来了。咔咔……来吧，让导师把你也改造成完美的硅基生命。��Isabella... my star pupil, you've finally returned. Clank clank... Come, let your mentor convert you too into perfect silicon-based life.]导师……你之前说的“进步世界”……原来是要把大家都变成机器吗？eMentor... the "world of progress" you spoke of... was it really about turning everyone into machines?H雷克斯哥哥！整个空港被迷雾包住了，一点都看不见！GBig bro Rex! The whole skyport is wrapped in fog—I can't see a thing!B坐稳，小火花。迷雾再厚，也挡不住我们冲进去！DHold on, Sparky. No fog is thick enough to stop us from charging in!<这里写着“远古战机”要降临！他们疯了吧！EIt says "ancient fighters" are about to descend! Have they gone mad?!6小火花，这预言有古怪。我们得撕开它。9Sparky, this prophecy is fishy. We need to tear it apart.6哇！他们全冲出来了，弹幕跟下雨一样！5Whoa! They all rushed out—the barrage is like rain!W小火花，护盾开满！今天让他们知道，真理不是靠弹幕堆出来的！HShields up, Sparky! Today we'll show them truth isn't built on barrages!-他们把远古战机叫醒了！好大呀！)They woke the ancient fighter! It's huge!K小火花，跟我一起！再大的机器，也挡不住正义的子弹！JSparky, with me! No machine, however big, can stop the bullets of justice!6团长亲自来了！她的幻影战机到处都是！AThe leader herself has come! Her phantom fighters are everywhere!?小火花，盯紧我。今天，我们把谎言彻底砸碎！=Stay close, Sparky. Today, we'll shatter the lies completely!<岛外围全是他们的王牌机队！我们被认出了！IThe island's perimeter is full of their ace squadron! We've been spotted!3那就让他们看看，谁才是碧波最快的！/Then let's show them who's the fastest in Biru!0他们抢这么多晶核，不是为了钱吗？<They're stealing so many Crystal Cores—isn't it for money?!烈风，你到底想干什么？ Gale, what are you really after??雷克斯哥哥！钢翼的无人机把整个港口封锁了！ABig bro Rex! The Steel Wing drones have blockaded the whole port!Q坐稳，小火花。今天让他们见识见识什么是真正的自由天空。AHold on, Sparky. Today we'll show them what true free skies mean.B找到他们的补给船队啦！炸掉它他们就没弹药啦～@Found their supply fleet! Blow it up and they'll be out of ammo~K干得好，小火花。让伯爵看看，断了粮的机械狗能咬谁。OWell done, Sparky. Let the Count see what his starved mechanical dogs can bite.3哇哇哇！无人机像蜜蜂一样扑过来了！0Whoa whoa! The drones are swarming in like bees!N小火花，护盾全开！今天我们给他们来个“蜂群恐惧症”！HShields full up, Sparky! Today we'll give them a case of "swarm phobia"!E雷克斯哥哥！要塞外面全是晶核炮塔，好亮好吓人！VBig bro Rex! The fortress is surrounded by Crystal Core turrets—so bright and scary!?小火花，别怕。今天我们把这些铁疙瘩全拆了！GDon't be scared, Sparky. Today we'll dismantle all these hunks of iron!$飓风混着能量波，好乱呀！1Hurricanes mixed with energy waves—what a mess!<抱紧！我们冲进风暴中心，把这鬼天气关掉！PHold tight! We'll charge into the storm's heart and shut off this awful weather!9他居然说要用星核统治整个云海！太坏了！MHe actually said he'd use the Star Core to rule the whole Cloud Sea! So evil!?霸权？今天就让他知道，云海的天空谁说了算。?Hegemony? Today we'll show him who rules the Cloud Sea's skies.*核心在裂开啦！能量场要炸了！8The core is cracking! The energy field is about to blow!<小火花，最后一击！让这破玩意儿彻底碎掉！4Sparky, final blow! Let's smash this junk to pieces!-统领亲自开着要塞来了！我们上！7The Commander himself drives the fortress in! Let's go!E来吧！今天告诉他，正义的光芒，比星核亮一万倍！iCome on! Today we'll show him the light of justice shines ten thousand times brighter than the Star Core!0雷克斯哥哥，沙尘里全是沙暴空贼！7Big bro Rex, the dust is full of sandstorm sky pirates!9坐稳，小火花，今天把他们从天上请下来。:Hold on, Sparky. Today we'll bring them down from the sky.6小鱼怕怕，沙尘里突然冒出好多飞机呀！?Xiaoyu's scared—so many planes suddenly appeared in the dust!0小鱼，鳌宝护好大家，跟我冲过去！5Xiaoyu, have Aobao protect everyone—charge with me!-抱歉，又晚了一步，沙漠太热了。)Sorry, late again—the desert's too hot.-铁之峰，你来得正好，一起清场！?Ironpeak, you're right on time—let's clear them out together!!看！他们的绿洲补给站！!Look! Their oasis supply station!3小火花，炸掉它，今天让他们渴着飞！,Sparky, blow it up—today they fly thirsty!!哇，好大的铁皮飞机呀！Whoa, what a big metal plane!6小鱼，鳌宝顶住，我们把它们赶回老巢！BXiaoyu, Aobao hold the line—let's drive them back to their lair!'首领发来决斗书，要一对一。,The boss sent a duel challenge—one on one.<告诉他，我们接受。今天沙漠只留一个主人。;Tell him we accept. Today the desert keeps only one master.*沙暴好猛，火花雀都飞不稳啦！?The sandstorm's fierce—even the Spark Finch can't fly steady!?小火花，坚持住！冲进中心就能抓住他们老大。AHold on, Sparky! Charge to the center and we'll catch their boss.'能量过载了，这烦人的热浪！*Energy overload—this annoying heat wave!3铁之峰，我们掩护你，稳住一起突破！AIronpeak, we'll cover you—steady, let's break through together!鳌宝，护住大家呀！Aobao, protect everyone!9小鱼干得漂亮！有你在，我们什么都不怕！2Great job, Xiaoyu! With you here, we fear nothing!$首领的大舰来了！我们上！&The boss's big ship is here! Let's go!B小火花，一起结束这场沙尘暴，让沙漠重见蓝天！RSparky, let's end this sandstorm together and let the desert see blue skies again!?雷克斯哥哥！绿洲被铁卫的机群围得水泄不通！HBig bro Rex! The oasis is surrounded airtight by the Iron Guard's fleet!?小火花，准备好。今天我们把封锁撕开一条路！@Get ready, Sparky. Today we'll tear a path through the blockade!-好多铁壳飞机呀！鳌宝有点怕怕！5So many iron-shelled planes! Aobao's a little scared!9小鱼别慌，鳌宝顶前面，我们一起冲过去！DDon't panic, Xiaoyu—Aobao up front, let's charge through together!'抱歉，沙漠热浪耽误了时间！"Sorry, the desert heat held me up!<铁之峰，来得正好！一起把铁卫的防线撞碎！PIronpeak, right on time! Let's smash through the Iron Guard's defenses together!!看！他们的能量塔好高！&Look! Their energy towers are so tall!9小火花，炸掉核心！今天让绿洲重见天空！FSparky, blow up the core! Today we'll let the oasis see the sky again!'统领的大铁舰来了！我们上！0The Commander's big iron ship is here! Let's go!9大家并肩！今天把绿洲从铁壳里解放出来！CEveryone together! Today we'll free the oasis from the iron shells!6他们把整个沙谷当擂台，观众全是空贼！NThey've made the whole sand valley an arena, with sky pirates as the audience!3竞技？好啊，今天我们陪他们玩到底。3A contest? Fine, today we'll play along to the end.3雷克斯哥哥！他们复制了我们的飞机！'Big bro Rex! They've copied our planes!?小火花，盯紧我。假的再像，也飞不出真本事！TStay close, Sparky. No matter how alike the fakes look, they can't match real skill!*冠军哥哥好快呀！鳌宝跟不上！,The champion's so fast! Aobao can't keep up!B小鱼，鳌宝稳住。今天让他知道，速度不是一切。BXiaoyu, Aobao steady. Today we'll show him speed isn't everything.*镜像太多，我的能量场都乱了！9Too many mirror images—my energy field's all messed up!E铁之峰，冷静。跟着我的节奏，一起把镜子全砸碎。OIronpeak, stay calm. Follow my rhythm—let's shatter all the mirrors together.$全场都在喊“冠军无敌”！8The whole crowd's chanting "the champion is invincible"!9小火花，告诉他们。今天冠军，要换人了！/Sparky, tell them. Today, the champion changes!3雷克斯哥哥！热浪里全是商盟的飞机！EBig bro Rex! The heat waves are full of the Merchant League's planes!6小火花，稳住。我们用策略找破绽突破。ISteady, Sparky. We'll find the weak spot with strategy and break through.-热浪好烫呀！商盟飞机藏在里面！DThe heat's scorching! The Merchant League's planes are hiding in it!6小鱼，鳌宝顶住。我们绕侧翼包抄他们。6Xiaoyu, Aobao hold on. We'll flank them from the side.-抱歉迟了！热浪干扰我的能量场。9Sorry I'm late! The heat waves disrupted my energy field.B铁之峰，正好！你的能量场稳住，我们一起推进。EIronpeak, perfect! Steady your energy field—let's advance together.3发现他们的补给点！热浪中心有弱处！CFound their supply point! There's a weak spot at the heat's center!<小火花，火花掩护。我们直取核心结束争斗。FSparky, give cover. We'll go straight for the core and end this fight.!首领的大舰来了！好热！$The boss's big ship is here! So hot!6小鱼，大家并肩！今天让热浪重归平静。;Xiaoyu, everyone together! Today we'll calm the heat waves.?雷克斯哥哥！那些塔全是用晶核堆的，好亮呀！IBig bro Rex! Those towers are all stacked with Crystal Cores—so bright!9小火花，护目镜戴好。今天我们把光关掉。<Sparky, put on your goggles. Today we'll shut off the light.0他们飞机碎了又出现！像魔法一样！/Their planes shatter and reappear—like magic!?小鱼，鳌宝顶住。我们找到阵眼，一次性全停。PXiaoyu, Aobao hold on. We'll find the formation's heart and stop it all at once.3我来了！我的能量场能压住晶核波动。EI'm here! My energy field can suppress the Crystal Core fluctuations.3铁之峰，稳住阵脚。我们配合你破阵。GIronpeak, hold your ground. We'll work with you to break the formation.0晶沙全亮了！领主的大舰升起来了！?The crystal sands are all aglow! The Lord's big ship is rising!?小火花，准备最后一击。今天让晶沙安静下来。BSparky, ready the final blow. Today we'll quiet the crystal sands.!晶沙在碎！要塞要塌啦！<The crystal sands are crumbling! The fortress is collapsing!<大家一起！最后一波，把沙漠的光还给天空！HEveryone together! Final wave—give the desert's light back to the sky!飓风丽萨Hurricane Lisa0雷克斯，天真的小子，还想说服我？0Rex, you naive boy, still trying to persuade me?B丽莎，你的自由不该伤害别人。今天结束这一切。>Lisa, your freedom shouldn't hurt others. Today this all ends.$来吧，让我见识你的正义！Come, show me your justice!9没想到…你变强了。或许，我错了点什么。FI didn't expect... you've grown stronger. Maybe I got something wrong.3丽莎，回头吧。云海需要真正的自由。2Lisa, turn back. The Cloud Sea needs true freedom.$丽莎，一起守护大家好吗？(Lisa, will you protect everyone with us?0…下次见面，再说吧。（机影远去）D...Let's talk next time we meet. (Her craft fades into the distance)0荣耀只属于掠夺者！叛徒，受死吧！,Glory belongs only to raiders! Traitor, die!9黑胡子，你错了！今天我来结束你的荣耀！4Blackbeard, you're wrong! Today I'll end your glory!��（狂笑）塔隆……你赢了……但荣耀永存！
— 赤狱机兵剧烈爆炸，黑胡子连同座驾在火光中消失 —��(Laughing wildly) Talon... you've won... but glory is eternal!
— The Crimson Hell Mech violently explodes; Blackbeard and his craft vanish in the flames —塔隆哥哥……他……Big bro Talon... he...*（沉默片刻）结束了……老大。((Silent for a moment) It's over... boss.B（远处惊叫）老大炸了！我们又要重新找饭碗啦！N(Screaming in the distance) The boss blew up! We've gotta find new jobs again!快跑啊！Run!……（扛着两人逃走）#...(carries the two away and flees)9星图选中的是我……我一定会让预言成真！<The star map chose me... I will make the prophecy come true!$幻月，你被那个预言骗了！-Phantom Moon, that prophecy has deceived you!B……怎么会……星图上明明写着我才是执行者……C...How could it be... The star map clearly says I'm the executor...幻月，你没事吧？ Phantom Moon, are you all right?6或许……真正能带来和平的，不是我……6Maybe... the one who can truly bring peace isn't me...<幻月，预言不是锁链。你可以选择自己的路。CPhantom Moon, prophecy isn't a chain. You can choose your own path.E哼，这次星图……好像真的算错了呢。再见啦各位。WHmph, this time the star map... really seems to have miscalculated. Farewell, everyone."幻月大人，别丢下我们哇~)Lady Phantom Moon, don't leave us behind~��咔咔……人类是落后的存在！本伯爵将把云海所有生物改造成永恒的机器生命！这是真正的进步！��Clank clank... Humans are a backward existence! I, the Count, will convert all life in the Cloud Sea into eternal machine life! This is true progress!H导师……我不想变成那样……我喜欢现在的人类样子！HMentor... I don't want to become that... I like being human as I am now!K咔咔……愚蠢的人类感情……今天本伯爵将亲自修正你！UClank clank... Foolish human emotions... Today I, the Count, will correct you myself!Z咔咔……计算……出错……伊莎贝拉……你还是这么……不听话……TClank clank... calculation... error... Isabella... you're still so... disobedient...导师……对不起……Mentor... I'm sorry...c咔咔……本伯爵……不会……就这样结束……（机体严重损坏，强行撤退）jClank clank... I, the Count... will not... end like this... (His body badly damaged, he forcibly retreats)小火花，你没事吧？Sparky, are you all right?L嗯……只是有点难过……他以前其实是个很好的老师…… AMm... just a little sad... He used to be a really good teacher...3太可怕了！我们差点就变成铁疙瘩了！4That was terrifying! We almost became hunks of iron!9我以后再也不随便投靠别人了……呜呜……9I'll never join someone so carelessly again... boo hoo...$高沉默：……（长长叹气）Tall Silent: ...(a long sigh)*雷克斯快看！空贼首领出现了！.Rex, look! The sky pirate leader has appeared!*走，让他们领略下天空的正义！3Let's go—let them taste the justice of the skies!周末宝箱Weekend Chest装备图纸包Equipment Blueprint Pack$打开随机获得一张装备图纸+Open to randomly get an equipment blueprint地图模式Map Mode普通装备箱Common Equipment Box*打开随机获得一件普通品质装备8Open to randomly get a Common-quality piece of equipment精良装备箱Fine Equipment Box*打开随机获得一件精良品质装备6Open to randomly get a Fine-quality piece of equipment活动获得Obtained from events稀有装备箱Rare Equipment Box*打开随机获得一件稀有品质装备6Open to randomly get a Rare-quality piece of equipment史诗装备箱Epic Equipment Box*打开随机获得一件史诗品质装备7Open to randomly get an Epic-quality piece of equipment传说装备箱Legendary Equipment Box*打开随机获得一件传说品质装备;Open to randomly get a Legendary-quality piece of equipment普通S装备箱Common S Equipment Box+打开随机获得一件普通品质S装备1Open to randomly get a Common-quality S equipment精良S装备箱Fine S Equipment Box+打开随机获得一件精良品质S装备/Open to randomly get a Fine-quality S equipment稀有S装备箱Rare S Equipment Box+打开随机获得一件稀有品质S装备/Open to randomly get a Rare-quality S equipment史诗S装备箱Epic S Equipment Box+打开随机获得一件史诗品质S装备0Open to randomly get an Epic-quality S equipment传说S装备箱Legendary S Equipment Box+打开随机获得一件传说品质S装备4Open to randomly get a Legendary-quality S equipment稀有战机碎片箱Rare Plane Shard Box*打开随机获得一个稀有战机碎片'Open to randomly get a Rare plane shard史诗战机碎片箱Epic Plane Shard Box*打开随机获得一个史诗战机碎片(Open to randomly get an Epic plane shard传说战机碎片箱Legendary Plane Shard Box*打开随机获得一个传说战机碎片,Open to randomly get a Legendary plane shard普通晶片Common Chip*打开随机获得一件普通品质晶片*Open to randomly get a Common-quality chip精良晶片	Fine Chip*打开随机获得一件精良品质晶片(Open to randomly get a Fine-quality chip稀有晶片	Rare Chip*打开随机获得一件稀有品质晶片(Open to randomly get a Rare-quality chip史诗晶片	Epic Chip*打开随机获得一件史诗品质晶片)Open to randomly get an Epic-quality chip传说晶片Legendary Chip*打开随机获得一件传说品质晶片-Open to randomly get a Legendary-quality chip神话晶片Mythic Chip*打开随机获得一件神话品质晶片*Open to randomly get a Mythic-quality chip执照心得书License Insight Book9打开随机获得一本飞行员心得或工程师心得8Open to randomly get a Pilot Insight or Engi