出现：追踪导弹登场，注意预警线最后停留的位置，就是他的撞击路线！cNew enemy: a Tracking Missile appears—where the warning line finally settles is its ramming path!c新敌机出现：镭射卫士登场，极有威胁的单位，锁定完毕后发射致命激光！gNew enemy: a Laser Guardian appears—a highly dangerous unit that fires a deadly laser once locked on!`新敌机出现：武装机器人登场，尽快击毁，一段时间后会发射狂暴弹幕！jNew enemy: an Armed Robot appears—destroy it quickly, or it'll unleash a frenzied barrage after a while!o新能力解锁：敌机被击杀时会掉落<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>核弹</c></outline>pNew ability unlocked: enemies drop <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Nukes</c></outline> when killed`新能力解锁：获得僚机<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>弹铳</c></outline>kNew ability unlocked: gain the wingman <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Slug Gun</c></outline>u新能力解锁：敌机被击杀时会掉落<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>火力全开</c></outline>yNew ability unlocked: enemies drop <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Full Firepower</c></outline> when killed~新能力解锁：碰撞伤害减免<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+<var=collide_damage>20</var>%</c></outline>��New ability unlocked: collision damage reduction <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+<var=collide_damage>20</var>%</c></outline>新能力解锁：地图和无尽模式里，初始多选<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>1</c></outline>次词条��New ability unlocked: in Map and Endless modes, get <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>1</c></outline> extra initial affix pickb新能力解锁：开场携带核弹<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>eNew ability unlocked: start with nukes <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>b新能力解锁：词条刷新次数<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>bNew ability unlocked: affix rerolls <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>��新敌机出现：局内会出现<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>宝箱怪</c></outline>，击落后获得一次词条选择机会。��New enemy: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>chest enemies</c></outline> appear in battle—destroy one to get an affix pick.��新敌机出现：局内会出现<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>运输机</c></outline>，击落后掉落随机道具。��New enemy: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>transports</c></outline> appear in battle—destroy one to drop a random item.~新能力解锁：护盾生效期间可以通过<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>撞击击杀</c></outline>敌机��New ability unlocked: while the shield is active, you can kill enemies by <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>collision</c></outline>\新能力解锁：僚机弹铳<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>eNew ability unlocked: Wingman Slug Gun <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>+1</c></outline>��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>高爆导弹</c></outline> 自动追踪敌机，击杀敌机会造成范围伤害。 擅长应对各种局面。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>HE Missile</c></outline> — automatically tracks enemies and deals area damage on kill. Versatile in any situation.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>聚能火箭</c></outline> 开火间隔久，伤害极高，命中后产生贯穿其他敌机的冲击波。擅长克制高血量单位。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Focused Rocket</c></outline> — long fire interval, extremely high damage; on hit it creates a shockwave that pierces other enemies. Strong against high-HP units.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>回旋镖</c></outline> 能穿透路线上的敌机，并在最远处停留造成持续伤害。擅长克制大型单位。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Boomerang</c></outline> — pierces enemies along its path and lingers at its farthest point dealing continuous damage. Strong against large units.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>高斯粒子</c></outline> 自动吸附发射角内的敌机，造成持续伤害直到目标被摧毁。擅长清场。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Gauss Particle</c></outline> — auto-locks onto enemies within its firing arc, dealing continuous damage until they are destroyed. Great for clearing the field.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>霰弹</c></outline> 瞬间发射大量弹幕，伤害高能击退靠近的敌机。擅长清场。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Shotgun</c></outline> — fires a burst of many bullets, dealing high damage and knocking back nearby enemies. Great for clearing the field.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>空雷</c></outline> 能抵消敌机子弹，爆炸会产生磁场消除范围内子弹。擅长消除弹幕威胁。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Air Mine</c></outline> — cancels enemy bullets; its explosion creates a magnetic field that clears bullets in range. Great against bullet hell.��新武器解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>波波枪</c></outline> 触碰屏幕边缘会反弹，能贯穿所有敌机，擅长应对各种局面。��New weapon unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>BB Gun</c></outline> — bounces off screen edges and pierces all enemies. Versatile in any situation.��新能力解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>防御装置</c></outline> 提供各种消除敌方攻击的防护能力，能极大提升战机的生存能力。��New ability unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Defense Device</c></outline> — provides various protective abilities that nullify enemy attacks, greatly boosting survivability.��新能力解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>火力装置</c></outline> 通过各种能力来强化战机的火力装置，有效提升战机的伤害。��New ability unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Firepower Device</c></outline> — enhances the plane's firepower with various abilities, effectively boosting its damage.��新能力解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>机体强化</c></outline> 强化战机机体，使其能抵御更多伤害。��New ability unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Hull Enhancement</c></outline> — reinforces the plane's hull so it can withstand more damage.��新能力解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>星章能力</c></outline> 通过在局内拾取星章来获得各种辅助能力，为战机提供更多的战术。��New ability unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Star Badge Ability</c></outline> — collect star badges in battle to gain various support abilities, giving the plane more tactics.��新能力解锁：<outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>作战策略</c></outline> 为应对不同敌情而设计的战术策略，适合不同作战风格的战机驾驶员。��New ability unlocked: <outline color=#21222E width=2><color=#BFFF64>Combat Strategy</c></outline> — tactical strategies designed for different enemy situations, suited to pilots of various combat styles.开服日期+0Launch Date +0默认Npc头像Default NPC Avatarnpc头像，不显示列表 NPC avatar, hidden from the list默认头像1Default Avatar 1初始头像Starting Avatar默认头像2Default Avatar 2默认头像3Default Avatar 3默认头像4Default Avatar 4 解锁战机"火花雀"后激活1Activated after unlocking the plane "Spark Finch"#解锁战机"闪电雷霆"后激活3Activated after unlocking the plane "Thunderstrike"解锁战机"红隼"后激活-Activated after unlocking the plane "Kestrel"丝兰Silan#解锁战机"深渊古龙"后激活4Activated after unlocking the plane "Abyssal Dragon"-解锁时装"星芒小子 雷克斯"后激活8Activated after unlocking the outfit "Starlight Kid Rex"-解锁时装"冠军荣耀 雷克斯"后激活;Activated after unlocking the outfit "Champion's Glory Rex"-解锁时装"冬日情愫 小火花"后激活<Activated after unlocking the outfit "Winter Romance Sparky"-解锁时装"魔法少女 小火花"后激活:Activated after unlocking the outfit "Magical Girl Sparky"-解锁时装"冠军荣耀 小火花"后激活>Activated after unlocking the outfit "Champion's Glory Sparky"*解锁时装"赏金骇客 塔隆"后激活:Activated after unlocking the outfit "Bounty Hacker Talon"*解锁时装"冠军荣耀 塔隆"后激活=Activated after unlocking the outfit "Champion's Glory Talon"*解锁时装"战斗修女 海莉"后激活8Activated after unlocking the outfit "Battle Nun Hailey"*解锁时装"冠军荣耀 海莉"后激活>Activated after unlocking the outfit "Champion's Glory Hailey"*解锁时装"绯夜魔姬 丝兰"后激活@Activated after unlocking the outfit "Crimson Night Witch Silan"*解锁时装"冠军荣耀 丝兰"后激活=Activated after unlocking the outfit "Champion's Glory Silan"S1赛季 1stSeason S1 1stS1赛季 2ndSeason S1 2ndS1赛季 3rdSeason S1 3rdS1赛季 top10Season S1 Top 10S1赛季 top100Season S1 Top 100S1赛季 纪念Season S1 Commemorative开服活动纪念Launch Event Commemorative友情主题Friendship Theme活动暂定Event Placeholder使用核弹Use Nuke�-实现逻辑：使用该技能就直接调用《buffer》表里对应的buff效果。 该配置有两个效果，分别是使用核弹和清除子弹。
