: After the shield is removed, the next damage taken cannot exceed 50% of max HP拾物冲击Pickup Shockwave冲击脉冲Shock Pulse质量生成器Mass Generator命扩波域HP Expansion Field护盾愈机Shield Heal.防御力场存在期间，对敌机伤害+15%9While the defense field is active, damage to enemies +15%核爆生盾Nuke Shield满命护生Full HP Guard火力加倍Firepower Double伤延狂火Damage-extend Frenzy Fire久待狂火Lingering Frenzy Fire?生命值低于15%时触发火力全开还会同时发动护罩>Triggering Full Firepower below 15% HP also activates a shield敌机Enemyc所有可以被攻击的敌方单位，击杀可以获得经验值，有几率掉落星章和道具bAll attackable enemy units; killing them grants EXP and has a chance to drop star badges and items星章
