ability击杀恢复Kill Recovery,每击杀10个敌机会恢复一定生命值,Restores some HP for every 10 enemies killed能量Energy'战机使用超武技能需要的资源7The resource the plane needs to use Super Weapon skills*拾取特定数量星章会触发的能力CAn ability triggered by collecting a specific number of star badges拾取恢复Pickup Recovery,每拾取10个星章会恢复一定生命值3Restores some HP for every 10 star badges collected核弹NukeM局内道具，击杀敌人有几率掉落，拾取后使可用核弹数量+1iAn in-battle item with a chance to drop from killed enemies; collecting it increases available nukes by 1B战机灵巧的避开来自敌机的撞击和子弹，免受伤害FThe plane nimbly avoids enemy collisions and bullets, taking no damage近距离击杀范围Close-kill Range_当敌机贴近战机时会出现近距离判定区，此时敌机会被标记，击杀得分X2{When enemies get close to the plane, a close-range zone appears; enemies in it are marked, and killing them grants 2x score全体All当前所拥有的所有战机All planes you currently own致死伤害Lethal DamageN导致战机死亡的伤害，通常这类伤害值大于战机当前生命值BDamage that would kill the plane, usually exceeding its current HP免疫死亡Death ImmunityU战机当次受到的伤害值如果大于生命值，战机至少保持1点生命值NIf the damage taken would exceed the plane's HP, the plane keeps at least 1 HP免疫致死伤害Lethal Damage ImmunityN战机当次受到的伤害值如果大于生命值，战机免疫当次伤害PIf the damage taken would exceed the plane's HP, the plane is immune to that hit伤害DamageW战机被子弹命中或者与敌机撞击就会受到伤害，减少战机的生命值UThe plane takes damage when hit by bullets or colliding with enemies, reducing its HP	经验值EXPc通过击杀敌机获得经验值，经验值可以提升战机等级，使战机获得新能力。QKilling enemies grants EXP; EXP raises the plane's level, granting new abilities.开火频率	Fire Rate!武器再次开火的间隔时间%The interval between a weapon's shots静止
