1. 共有两类首领可以挑战，分别为空贼首领与恶党头目
2. 需要满足等级与战力要求才可以挑战对应的首领
3. 仅在限定时间内击败首领，才算挑战成功，获取奖励
4. 挑战失败，悬赏令会返回，但不能超过每天的可拥有上限�OBoss Challenge guide:
1. There are two types of bosses to challenge: Sky Pirate Leaders and Gang Bosses
2. You must meet the level and power requirements to challenge a boss
3. Only defeating the boss within the time limit counts as success and grants rewards
4. On failure, the Bounty is returned, but not above your daily holding cap��金币大战玩法介绍：
1. 金币大战玩法不限次数，通关层数越多，扫荡奖励越多
2. 扫荡次数每天重置满足等级要求才能参与金币大战玩法
3. 仅在限定时间内击毁所有陨石才算通过
�Coin War guide:
1. Coin War has unlimited attempts; the more floors you clear, the greater the sweep rewards
2. Sweep counts reset daily; you must meet the level requirement to play Coin War
3. Only destroying all meteors within the time limit counts as a clear
�4空贼讨伐玩法介绍：
1. 只有击杀空贼首领才算通过
2. 总共有三种颜色的守卫抵挡玩家，红色生命值最高，紫色次之，绿色最低
3. 守卫中有爆炸飞艇，击杀后能炸毁整排空贼
4. 挑战失败，悬赏令会返回，但不能超过每天的可拥有上限
�[Sky Pirate Hunt guide:
1. Only killing the Sky Pirate Leader counts as a clear
2. There are three colors of guards blocking you: red has the most HP, then purple, then green
3. Among the guards are explosive airships; killing one can blow up an entire row of sky pirates
4. On failure, the Bounty is returned, but not above your daily holding cap
