4.每次锁定晶片，同一词条、品质、部位的晶片只能锁住一颗，多出的晶片必定被送入合成界面，且在晶片详情不显示上锁按钮
5.稀有词条晶片会显示 “稀有” 标签，点击合成会有二次确认��1. Consume 5 chips of the same slot and quality to synthesize 1 random higher-quality chip of the same slot
2. In the synthesis screen, tap the lock button in a chip's details to lock it; locked chips are automatically removed from the synthesis screen and can't be used
3. After locked chips are removed, qualifying chips from your bag automatically fill the synthesis screen; if there aren't enough chips to synthesize, all non-qualifying chips are removed
4. When locking chips, only one chip per affix, quality, and slot can be locked; extra chips are always sent to the synthesis screen and show no lock button in their details
